    "updated_at": "2016-07-14T17:45:56Z",
    "body": "Here is how I think this happened. loadstart existed for media elements (audio, video). When introducing responsive images, loadstart was reused and loadend was added for img, I think. But whoever added that (@zcorpan, if my assumption about this being responsive image related is correct) did not add an onloadend.\n",
